    "topic_path": "Introduction to Principles of Management/Your Principles of Management Survivor’s Guide/Learn",
    "content": "You have probably learned a little about a certain subject just by virtue of gauging your depth in it. In some cases, you might even have read up on the subject a lot to accurately gauge where you were strong or weak. There is not an existing survey for every subject, and it is beneficial to learn how you might gauge this or that area of interest.",
